<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY JULY 96 CEN.BANK RESERVES $9.4 BLN.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY JULY 96 CEN.BANK RESERVES $9.4 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The reserves of the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) stood at $9.4 billion at the end of July, down from $9.8 billion at the end of June, the NBH said on Monday.</p>
<p>					    JULY 96	   JUNE J96</p>
<p>HUNGARY RESERVES ($ million)</p>
<p>    International reserves	  9,448.2	   9,835.1</p>
<p>	Of which gold			41.2		40.7</p>
<p>    Other foreign assets	    3,820.2	   3,421.1</p>
<p>NOTE - The NBH values gold at London market prices.</p>
<p>	    -- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327-4040</p>
